  "bio": "Welcome to Gold Tattoo, Alegrete's premier destination for captivating illustrative ink art. Nestled in the heart of Brazil's vibrant culture, our studio boasts masterful artists like @ink.vtr and @tatt.mat, who are dedicated to transforming your skin into a canvas of personal expression. Experience the fusion of creativity and tradition at Gold Tattoo, where every design tells a story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Alegrete, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil"
